Build
------------------
cd ~/src/dndapp
mvn package -P gae-executable -DskipTests
Output: target/dndapp-15.war


Deploy to App Engine (Web UI)
--------------------------------
cd ~/src/dndapp

mvn package -P gae-executable -DskipTests

# Must delete these files — otherwise Spring Boot won't start
rm -f target/appengine-staging/WEB-INF/quickstart-web.xml \
      target/appengine-staging/WEB-INF/min-quickstart-web.xml

gcloud app deploy target/appengine-staging \
  --project=dndtool-227201 \
  --quiet
URL: https://dndtool-227201.appspot.com/


Deploy to Cloud Run (MCP Server)
--------------------------------
cd ~/src/dndapp

mvn package -P gae-executable -DskipTests

cp target/dndapp-15.war /tmp/cloudrun-build/dndapp-15.war

gcloud run deploy dndapp \
  --source /tmp/cloudrun-build \
  --region=us-central1 \
  --project=dndtool-227201 \
  --session-affinity \
  --timeout=3600 \
  --max-instances=1 \
  --set-env-vars=SPRING_AI_MCP_SERVER_ENABLED=true \
  --quiet
URL: https://dndapp-360244136999.us-central1.run.app


Note
-----------------------------
\App Engine	Cloud Run
Purpose	Web UI	MCP server for Claude Desktop
MCP enabled	No	Yes (via env var)
Why delete quickstart-web.xml	App Engine staging generates this file which disables Spring Boot's servlet initializer	N/A
Why /tmp/cloudrun-build	Contains a Dockerfile that wraps the WAR with Java 21	—
